> Different topic - I've read that Mjollnir is considered to be one of
> the weaker artifacts. =A0I'm playing as a Valk and I have the gauntlets
> of power. =A0It seems pretty nice to me. =A0I'm planning to continue with
> Mjollnir and keep Excalibur in my bag. =A0Thoughts?

Mjollnir is strong in the early game when few monsters are immune
to shock then weak in the later game when more and more monsters
are immune to shock.  The later in the game the worse it compares
against the other commonly discussed artifact weapons.  And it
destroys items carried by monsters.

I prefer Excalibur because it's a good weapon the whole game as
far as damage, it does not destroy items carried by monsters, and
confers other advantages.  Plus since a valk starts with a long sword
I will have started exercising the skill early on.  Dagger is an early
priority but after thal long sword class.


